title: Economic Democracy
is-card: true
new-page: true
on-arrival: economic_democracy_timer += 10; month_actions += 1
view-if: spd_in_government and (economic_minister_party == "SPD" or finance_minister_party == "SPD") and (labor_minister_party == "SPD") and economic_democracy_timer <= 0
card-image: img/portraits/HilferdingRudolf.jpg
max-visits: 8
tags: govt_affairs, cabinet

= Economic Democracy

Codetermination is one of the great achievements of German social democracy: in large companies, workers elect half of the supervisory board. But fewer and fewer companies are covered, as firms stay just under the thresholds or move their legal seat abroad.

As we control the labour [? if economic_minister_party == "SPD" : and economics ?][? if finance_minister_party == "SPD" : and finance ?] ministries, we can do something about it. [? if in_grand_coalition: Our partners on the centre-right may not agree, however. ?]

- @expand_councils
- @expand_councils_2
- @expand_councils_3
- @nationalize_1
- @cooperatives_1
- @return: Do not enact any policies for now.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@expand_councils
title: Close the codetermination loopholes.
subtitle: Stop companies from escaping codetermination through European company law.
view-if: works_councils == 0
on-arrival: economic_democracy += 1; workers_spd += 5*(1-dissent); capital_strike_progress += 1; works_councils += 1; labor_dissent -= 6; labor_strength += 8; fdp_relation -= 5; coalition_dissent +=1 if in_grand_coalition
max-visits: 1

Companies that converted into a European company to avoid codetermination now have to give their workers seats on the board.

@expand_councils_2
title: Extend codetermination to more companies.
subtitle: Parity on the board from 1,000 employees instead of 2,000.
view-if: works_councils == 1
on-arrival: economic_democracy += 1; workers_spd += 6*(1-dissent); capital_strike_progress += 1; works_councils += 1; labor_dissent -= 6; labor_strength += 8; fdp_relation -= 5; coalition_dissent +=1 if in_grand_coalition; economic_growth += 0.1 if economic_growth < 3
max-visits: 1

Hundreds more companies now have workers on their supervisory boards. Business associations warn that Germany is becoming less attractive to investors.

@expand_councils_3
title: Give works councils a say over investment and relocation.
subtitle: Workers must agree before a plant is closed or moved abroad.
view-if: works_councils == 2
on-arrival: economic_democracy += 1; workers_spd += 7*(1-dissent); capital_strike_progress += 2; works_councils += 1; labor_dissent -= 6; labor_strength += 8; fdp_relation -= 5; cdu_relation -= 3; coalition_dissent +=1 if in_grand_coalition; unemployment_rate -= 0.3 if unemployment_rate > 5; economic_growth += 0.1 if economic_growth < 3
max-visits: 1

Works councils can now block plant closures and relocations unless the company offers a plan for the site and its workers. The unions call it the biggest advance since 1976.

@nationalize_1
title: Bring key infrastructure into public ownership.
subtitle: -1 budget. Buy back the power grids, railway infrastructure and large housing companies.
on-arrival: economic_democracy += 1; capital_strike_progress += 1; budget -= 1; socializations += 1; workers_spd += 5*(1-dissent); unemployed_spd += 2*(1-dissent); coalition_dissent += 1 if in_grand_coalition; capital_strike_progress += 1 if recession_seen; unemployment_rate -= 0.3 if unemployment_rate > 6; economic_growth += 0.1 if economic_growth < 5; economy_goal_completed += 1
choose-if: budget >= 1
max-visits: 3

[? if socializations == 1 : The federal government buys the transmission grid operators, so that the energy transition is planned in public hands. ?][? if socializations == 2 : Following the Berlin referendum of 2021, we buy the largest housing companies and put their flats under public and tenant control. ?][? if socializations >= 3 : The rail network, the hospitals and the water companies return to public ownership. ?] Business groups warn of a return to state socialism.

@cooperatives_1
title: Support cooperatives.
subtitle: -1 budget. Energy, housing and worker cooperatives.
on-arrival: economic_democracy += 1; cooperatives += 1; workers_spd += 3*(1-dissent); unemployed_spd += 2*(1-dissent); rural_spd += 2*(1-dissent); budget -= 1; unemployment_rate -= 0.2 if unemployment_rate > 6; economic_growth += 0.2
choose-if: budget >= 1
max-visits: 3

We make it easier to found cooperatives and give them cheap loans, from village wind parks to housing cooperatives in the cities.
